IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hw-waste-movements`

-- Hazardous Waste (Control of Export, Import and Transit) Act 1997, ss 4 to 6, 12, 22, 23, 25 to 37, 42, 45 and Annex II -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_hazardous-waste-control-of-export-import-and-transit-act-1997.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`spent batteries with an Annex III characteristic` MEANS Waste WITH
    `is waste within s 2` IS TRUE
    `prescribed by regulations` IS FALSE
    `in an Annex I category` IS TRUE
    `has an Annex III characteristic` IS TRUE
    `in an Annex II category` IS FALSE
    `from the normal operations of a ship` IS FALSE
    `radioactive` IS FALSE

