§ `ss 4, 5, 9 and 10`

#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `spent batteries with an Annex III characteristic` `import` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `an Annex I sludge with no Annex III characteristic` `import` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `a prescribed waste with no Annex III characteristic` `import` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `household rubbish` `export` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `a ship's oily bilge waste` `import` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `a household item being sold, not discarded` `import` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `export` `a Basel party with no listing`
#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `export` `a Basel party listing it as hazardous`
#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `transit` `a Basel party listing it as hazardous`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `import` `a Basel party listing it as hazardous`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `export` `a non-party listing it as hazardous`
#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `import` `an Article 11 partner controlling it`
#ASSERT NOT `is hazardous or other waste` `spent batteries with an Annex III characteristic` `export` `an Article 11 partner excluding it`
#ASSERT `is hazardous or other waste` `uncategorised scrap` `export` `a country the Minister has declared for`

